{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The new regression tests pass, but the sweep found two remaining gaps. Dependency matching returns the first matching path before filtering discovered modules, so it can hide a later dependency that should select the consumer. Also, HEAD movement now clears `material_clean`, but leaves the old material bindings available to delivery consumers that do not read that flag.\n\nI’m checking the remaining filesystem-alias case before concluding the review.\n"}}
