{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"Two further cases remain in the reviewed control flow. The symlink guard does not detect case aliases on a case-insensitive Unix filesystem. Also, the run captures `git_head` after planning: if HEAD advances in that gap, selection can use the old tree while provenance and the final head check use the new one.\n\nThe focused and broader tests, race tests, and vet passed. Both required validation runs remain limited by sandbox write failures; I’ll report those separately from the sealed passing matrix.\n"}}
